  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### API slowdown holds workflow tasks open\n**Guide:** Failure modes: row 1  \u00b7  **Symptom:** Workflow task latency and schedule-to-start rise together; queries (and signals/updates) lag.  \u00b7  **Cause:** API slowdown keeps workflow tasks open; workflow task slots fill.  \u00b7  **Fix:** Tight ScheduleToClose; circuit breaker in the activity; fail fast to a fallback.\n\n**What to watch:** Workflow task execution latency, query latency, workflow task heartbeats and end-to-end latency in the broken window; breaker state and 'deferred' results in the fixed window.\n\n| # | Variant | Phase | Length | What changes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | baseline | normal | 45 s |  |\n| 2 | broken | API 15x slower, patient policy | 120 s | StartToClose 10 s, ScheduleToClose 30 s, unlimited retries, no breaker, no fallback. |\n| 3 | baseline | recover | 60 s |  |\n| 4 | fixed | API 15x slower, budgeted + breaker + fallback | 120 s | ScheduleToClose 2 s, StartToClose 500 ms, breaker opens at 50% failures, workflow returns 'deferred'. |\n| 5 | baseline | normal | 45 s |  |\n\nRun it from the [control page](http://localhost:8088). Blue regions mark phases; red markers are crashes and restarts."
   },
   "id": 1,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 7
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "state-timeline",
